  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs a member, I want to mark an MP thread unread, delete it and see who is in a group MP, so that I manage my MPs as before.\n\n### Scope\n\nSwipes/context menu on MP rows; delete asks confirmation; members list for group threads.\n\n- Module: App · Difficulty: easy · Priority: medium · post-MVP\n- Implements: legacy parity (no FEAT)\n- Absorbs: FEATURES 'Not to lose': MP actions (mark unread, delete)\n- Legacy sources (read-only, `origin/master`): `MPListView.swift` (`ForumMPTopicActionService.markTopicUnread`, `deleteTopic`)\n- Spec: `docs/lots/LOT-127-*.md`\n\n### Depends on\n\n- LOT-058 (#84, done)\n- LOT-094 (#186, done)\n- LOT-126 (#217, done)\n\n### Blocked by\n\nnone: every dependency is merged\n\n### Model\n\nOpus → Fable (AGENTS.md §6: the reviewer is never the author model)\n\n### Captures needed\n\n- CAP-N1 (#169): MP thread delete: the answer of `modo/manageaction.php` (legacy `MPListView.swift:37-80`) on success and on refusal, and the MP list right after\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Delete removes the row only after HFR confirmed it.\n- [ ] View logic lives in `@Observable @MainActor` models tested with Swift Testing in `App/SwiftHFRTests/`; each new test is shown to fail without the change.\n- [ ] `xcodebuild build test` green on the iPhone 18 Pro and an iPad simulator (iOS 27.0), and the `App build + tests` CI job green.\n- [ ] UI strings in French; light, dark and Dynamic Type XL checked; no new dependency; no HFR fact without a source (legacy file:line or fixture).\n\n### Before you start (agents and humans)\n\nRead, in order: AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/agents/ORCHESTRATION.md, docs/agents/REVIEW-ROUNDS.md, docs/agents/LESSONS.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, App/README.md, ADR 0012, the spec of every dependency (docs/lots/), docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md for any forum fact, docs/FIXTURES.md if captures are involved. Claim with `/claim <session-id>` on this issue before writing code; PR body `Closes #<this issue>` + `Claim: <session-id>`; never guess HFR behaviour (stop and list the captures needed).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
